"""
## Purpose and audience
Pins the observable execution contract of the BuildTestIntegration subsystem spec lane
(build_test_integration_1_spec.spl): every scenario asserts a concrete language/stdlib outcome the runner
must report green for this subsystem spec to carry evidence weight.
Audience: compiler and test-infrastructure engineers triaging the BuildTestIntegration lane.
## Operator workflow
Run `bin/simple test test/integration/e2e/build_test_integration_1_spec.spl` and read the per-scenario verdicts in the
`Results:` summary; each scenario asserts one externally visible outcome.
## Compatibility and limitations
Covers interpreter-path semantics exercised by this lane; native codegen
and performance envelopes are out of scope.
# @manual: primary
REQ-SYS-BuildTestIntegration-001
doc/01_research/local/BuildTestIntegration_lane.md
doc/03_plan/sys_test/BuildTestIntegration_lane.md
doc/04_architecture/BuildTestIntegration_lane.md
doc/05_design/BuildTestIntegration_lane.md
